<title>SWITZERLAND: Roche H1 report due on August 27.</title>
<headline>Roche H1 report due on August 27.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss pharmaceuticals group Roche Holding AG said it would report its half-year results early on Tuesday, August 27.</p>
<p>A Roche spokeswoman said the results would be issued between 0600 and 0700 GMT on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
